  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The mass of a solid metal cube is three times the mass of a solid metal sphere. The radius of the sphere is half that of the side length of the cube. </p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{density of cube}}{\\textup{density of sphere}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{8}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{8}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
